{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"b0a2601e-c4a4-483","type":"toolResult","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01V2htUuE9JgnmRZ99CqyfJJ","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"registerToolOverrides\": {\n    \"read\": true,\n    \"grep\": true,\n    \"find\": true,\n    \"ls\": true,\n    \"bash\": true,\n    \"edit\": true,\n    \"write\": true\n  },\n  \"customToolOverrides\": {},\n  \"enableNativeUserMessageBox\": true,\n  \"readOutputMode\": \"summary\",\n  \"searchOutputMode\": \"count\",\n  \"mcpOutputMode\": \"summary\",\n  \"previewLines\": 8,\n  \"expandedPreviewMaxLines\": 4000,\n  \"bashOutputMode\": \"summary\",\n  \"bashCollapsedLines\": 5,\n  \"diffViewMode\": \"auto\",\n  \"diffIndicatorMode\": \"bars\",\n  \"diffSplitMinWidth\": 120,\n  \"diffCollapsedLines\": 24,\n  \"diffWordWrap\": true,\n  \"showTrun\u2026"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791109952429},"timestamp":"2026-10-04T10:32:32.462Z","cwd":"/Users/andraspalasti/fun/agent"}
{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"b0a2601e-c4a4-483","type":"toolResult","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01BR8msy1HE7caiNhUtViWNf","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Paste Detector Extension\n\nAutomatically detects pasted code snippets and replaces them with file references.\n\n## What it does\n\nWhen you paste code into pi:\n\n1. **Detects** multi-line code snippets in your input\n2. **Searches** the codebase using ripgrep (`rg`)\n3. **Replaces** found code with `[Found in path/to/file.ts:line-range]`\n4. **Ignores** if not found \u2014 original text is sent unchanged\n5. **Respects** `.gitignore` automatically (via ripgrep)\n\n## Features\n\n\u2705 Automatic `.gitignore` support  \n\u2705 Fast fixed-string search (no regex overhead)  \n\u2705 Skips git-ignored files  \n\u2705 Ignores commands (\u2026"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791109952429},"timestamp":"2026-10-04T10:32:32.471Z","cwd":"/Users/andraspalasti/fun/agent"}
{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"b0a2601e-c4a4-483","type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\u001b[38;5;5mThinking:\u001b[39m \u001b[39m\u001b[2mI still need to pin down a few things: git-diffstat UI customization, herdr's event pipeline, how session names relate to model calls, and whether watch-pr gets used elsewhere. Let me quickly verify herdr's API and the LLM call tied to session naming before moving on.\u001b[22;39m","thinkingSignature":"\u2026"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01AKxWSuGGmE6AnReVvPEQbi","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/andraspalasti/.pi/agent/extensions/; sed -n 1,30p herdr-agent-state.ts | cut -c1-140; grep -n \"complete\\|modelRegistry\\|getApiKey\\|events\\.\\|registerTool\\|\\.on(\" session-name/*.ts watch-pr/index.ts paste-detector/index.ts git-diffstat/*.ts | cut -c1-150 | head -30; sed -n 1,12p session-name/index.ts","timeout":120}}],"api":"claude-bridge","provider":"claude-bridge","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":313,"cacheRead":11406,"cacheWrite":7878,"totalTokens":19599,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"reasoning":93},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1791109952483,"thinkingLevel":"low"},"timestamp":"2026-10-04T10:32:36.314Z","cwd":"/Users/andraspalasti/fun/agent"}
{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"b0a2601e-c4a4-483","type":"toolResult","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01AKxWSuGGmE6AnReVvPEQbi","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// installed by herdr\n// managed by herdr; reinstalling or updating the integration overwrites this file.\n// add custom hooks/plugins beside this file instead of editing it.\n// HERDR_INTEGRATION_ID=pi\n// HERDR_INTEGRATION_VERSION=5\n// @ts-nocheck\n\nimport { createConnection } from \"node:net\";\n\nconst HERDR_ENV = process.env.HERDR_ENV;\nconst socketPath = process.env.HERDR_SOCKET_PATH;\nconst paneId = process.env.HERDR_PANE_ID;\nconst source = \"herdr:pi\";\n\nfunction enabled() {\n  return HERDR_ENV === \"1\" && !!socketPath && !!paneId;\n}\n\nfunction sendRequestAttempt(request: unknown, timeoutMs: number):\u2026"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791109956299},"timestamp":"2026-10-04T10:32:36.326Z","cwd":"/Users/andraspalasti/fun/agent"}
{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"b0a2601e-c4a4-483","type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All eight extensions are under `/Users/andraspalasti/.pi/agent/extensions/`. None uses `registerTool`, `registerShortcut`, `registerFlag`, `registerProvider`, `registerMcpServer` or `appendEntry`.\n\n**git-diffstat/** (~350 lines across `index.ts`, `branch-picker.ts`, `tree.ts`, `view.ts`; self-contained)\n- It adds a `/diffstat` command that picks a base branch and shows a tree view of the diffstat against the current branch.\n- It uses `pi.registerCommand(\"diffstat\")`, `pi.exec(\"git\", \u2026)`, `ctx.ui.custom(...)` for the picker and viewer, and `ctx.ui.notify`.\n- It registers no `pi.on` events and p\u2026"}],"api":"claude-bridge","provider":"claude-bridge","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":2349,"cacheRead":19284,"cacheWrite":1253,"totalTokens":22888,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"reasoning":0},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1791109956336,"thinkingLevel":"low"},"timestamp":"2026-10-04T10:32:51.075Z","cwd":"/Users/andraspalasti/fun/agent"}
